  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\n**Option 1 :** **8 and 2; × and ÷**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**36 ÷ 2 – 159 + 78 × 18 = 135**\n\n**After interchange the signs;**\n\n**36 × 8 – 159 + 72 ÷ 12 = 135**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n**36 × 8 – 159 + 6 = 135**\n\n**288 – 159 + 6 = 135**\n\n**294 – 159 = 135**\n\n**135 = 135 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2 : 5 and 8; + and -\n\nGiven: \n\n36 ÷ 2 – 159 + 78 × 18 = 135\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n36 ÷ 2 + 189 - 75 × 15 = 138\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n18 + 189 - 75 × 15 = 138\n\n18 + 189 - 1125 = 138\n\n207 - 1125 = 138\n\n- 918 = 138** (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3: **8 and 7; × and ÷\n\nGiven:\n\n36 ÷ 2 – 159 + 78 × 18 = 135\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n36 × 2 – 159 + 87 ÷ 17 = 135\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n36 × 2 – 159 + 5.12 = 135\n\n72 – 159 + 5.12 = 135\n\n77.12 – 159 = 135\n\n- 81.88 = 135 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 4: **6 and 8; + and –\n\nGiven:\n\n36 ÷ 2 – 159 + 78 × 18 = 135\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n38 ÷ 2 – 159 + 76 × 16 = 135\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n19 – 159 + 76 × 16 = 135\n\n19 – 159 + 1216 = 135\n\n1235 – 159 = 135\n\n1076 = 135 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is **“****8 and 2; × and ÷****”.**",
